<title>HONG KONG: Bakrie Indonesia BV launches US$50 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Bakrie Indonesia BV launches US$50 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch Far East.</p>
<p>The guarantor of the bond, Bakrie Investindo, owns part of Indonesian listed company Bakrie and Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAKRIE INDONESIA BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PT BAKRIE INVESTINDO</p>
<p> AMT   US$50 MLN     COUPON     9.625 PCT  MATURITY   17.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE  EUROBOND	SPREAD     400 BP     PAY DATE   17.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY NONE     ISS PRICE  99.732     LAUNCH     06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   NONE     REOFFER    99.732     FULL FEES  150 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	DENOMS (K) 10K/100K/1MLN</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS UK/INDONESIA/US NOT 144A, TEFRA D, REG.S</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50BP     SELL CONC  100BP	PAY FREQ    SEMI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	CRS DEFLT  YES	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH  HOME CTRY  INDONESIA</p>
<p> NOTES - **PRICED TO YIELD 9.73 PCT, OR 400 BP, OVER THE 5-7/8</p>
<p>	   PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE NOV 1999</p>
<p> LEAD    MERRILL LYNCH FAR EAST</p>
<p> CO-LEAD BA ASIA, CHASE MANHATTAN INTERNATIONAL, DAIWA</p>
<p>	   SECURITIES (HK) AND SBC WARBURG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
